# The tests of the PostgreSQL database (see config.libobe.test.pgsql).

: migrate
: Test that migrating creates only our schema, then finds it current, and
: refuses a newer one
:
: The ODB schema catalog is process-wide and has the schemas of all the
: libraries linked into the process (xle's, for example), which must be
: neither created nor versioned with ours.
:
if ($pgsql != [null])
{
  $* $pgsql >>EOO
  migrated 0
  migrated 1
  tables 3
  versions 1
  version obe 1
  table file 1
  table performance 1
  table schema_version 1
  schema version 2
  refused: database schema version 2 is newer than 1
  EOO
}
